  "body": "## Overview\nThese requirements cover booking, cancelling and room administration.\n## Requirements\n- FR-001 The system shall refuse a booking for a slot that is already taken, for PER-001. Derives from: PER-001, REQ-PRB-001\n- FR-002 The system shall let a room administrator add, rename and retire rooms. Derives from: PER-002, SET-CHR-001\n## Business rules\nBookings last up to four hours and only within office hours [DOC-001#1].\n## Traceability notes\nDerived from the charter [SET-CHR-001], the personas [REQ-PER-001] and the problem [REQ-PRB-001].\n## Open questions\nIs there a limit on how far ahead a room can be booked?",
